No endorsement or affiliation with the upstream team is implied.

LUNAR modifications: original product interface and guide, Basic/Advanced,
original SVG bearings, base-layout screening, project handling, scientific
workspace, native global DEM input, adjustable shadow fill, WebGL fallback,
Python eclipse model, validation audit, launch/build/release tools and docs.
Modified upstream files retain notices; additional source paths are listed in
qa/upstream_changes.json. Original LUNAR archives remain separate from new work.

Non-NASA welcome/mission artwork, screenshots, promotional narratives and
spacecraft showcases are not used by the V1 application. NASA-origin terrain
and imagery retain their credits in their metadata. Original upstream docs are
preserved under upstream-docs and upstream-pipeline for attribution/provenance.

